sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User/CLI/API
    participant C as ApplicationContainer
    participant ORCH as SolveOrchestrator
    participant CTX as DecisionRelevantContextBuilder
    participant CMP as DecisionCompiler
    participant UE as UncertaintyEngine
    participant RP as ResearchPlanner
    participant RUN as ResearchRun(Search+Adapter)
    participant DD as EvidenceDedupEngine
    participant CB as ClaimBindingEngine
    participant EP as EvidencePolicy
    participant CON as ConflictEngine
    participant BE as BeliefEngine
    participant STOP as ResearchStopRule
    participant CE as ConvergenceEngine
    participant DE as DecisionEngine
    participant SEN as DecisionSensitivityEngine
    participant EO as ExperimentOptimizer
    participant PL as PredictionLedger
    participant REPO as Repository

    U->>C: solve(project_id, problem_text, ...)
    C->>ORCH: orchestrator.solve(req)
    ORCH->>CTX: build_for_decision(project_id)
    CTX-->>ORCH: ContextBundleV11
    ORCH->>CMP: compile(problem, context)
    CMP-->>ORCH: CompiledDecision (candidate)
    ORCH->>REPO: persist objective/claims/beliefs(canonical wins)
    ORCH->>UE: rank(decision, beliefs)
    UE-->>ORCH: critical_uncertainties
    ORCH->>RP: plan(decision, beliefs, criticals, context)
    RP-->>ORCH: ResearchPlan
    ORCH->>REPO: save_research_plan + RESEARCH_PLANNED
    loop 每轮研究（max research_max_rounds）
        ORCH->>RUN: run(questions)
        RUN-->>ORCH: candidate evidence[]
        ORCH->>DD: group(candidates)
        DD-->>ORCH: DedupResult (dropped/kept+groups)
        ORCH->>CB: process(results, context)
        CB->>EP: grade(bound evidence)
        CB-->>ORCH: bindings/unbound/applied/rejected + events
        ORCH->>CON: detect(evidence_by_claim)
        CON-->>ORCH: conflicts[]
        ORCH->>BE: update(beliefs, applied, records)
        BE-->>ORCH: beliefs + BeliefUpdateRecord[] (posterior_version++)
        ORCH->>STOP: evaluate(traces, before/after, ...)
        STOP-->>ORCH: ResearchStopReport
        alt RESEARCH_MORE
            Note over ORCH,RUN: 继续下一轮
        else SEARCH_EXHAUSTED / EXPERIMENT_REQUIRED
            ORCH->>REPO: RESEARCH_EXHAUSTED 事件
        end
    end
    ORCH->>UE: rank(decision, updated beliefs)
    ORCH->>CE: check(...)
    CE-->>ORCH: convergence
    ORCH->>DE: evaluate(...)
    DE-->>ORCH: DecisionResult + DecisionTrace
    ORCH->>SEN: compute(decision, beliefs, result)
    SEN-->>ORCH: DecisionSensitivity (flips/robustness/what_could_change_my_mind)
    alt ABSTAIN / 未收敛
        ORCH->>EO: propose(validate+brank)
        EO-->>ORCH: ranked experiments + criteria
    end
    ORCH->>PL: register(decision, beliefs)
    ORCH->>REPO: persist decision/trace/sensitivity/predictions/traces
    ORCH-->>U: SolveResultV11（标准输出段）
